      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-27768",
      ":question/problem": "Two dogs are running around an $8$-meter roundabout. The big dog runs at a constant speed of $2$ meters per second, while the small one runs at a constant speed of $1$ meter per second. If they started running from the same point at the same time, how long does it take for the big dog to lap the small dog?"
