      ":question/problem": "Alice and Brian are running laps around a $400$-meter track. Alice runs at a constant speed of $4$ meters per second, while Brian runs at a constant speed of $3$ meters per second. If they started running at the same time and from the same position, after how many minutes will Alice first lap Brian?"
